From a6c16316714f916cfc642b094ed799c59b9f3059 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charliechen114514 <725610365@qq.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 21:56:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] configs: evb-rk3588: direct bootcmd to eMMC boot.scr (bypass
 bootflow)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The bootstd default bootcmd ("bootflow scan -lb") does NOT find boot.scr on this board's eMMC — the script bootmeth doesn't match mmc 0:3, so autoboot scans mmc0, finds nothing, and drops to the prompt. The manual sequence `load mmc 0:3 ${scriptaddr} /boot/boot.scr; source` is known-working (boot.scr then raw-reads the boot partition at 0x6000 + bootm). Bake it into CONFIG_BOOTCOMMAND so the board autoboots. boot_targets (patch 0001) is now moot but harmless.

Signed-off-by: Charliechen114514 <725610365@qq.com>
---
 configs/evb-rk3588_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/configs/evb-rk3588_defconfig b/configs/evb-rk3588_defconfig
index 0e679cc7fc0..3a8dbfcfbef 100644
--- a/configs/evb-rk3588_defconfig
+++ b/configs/evb-rk3588_defconfig
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@ CONFIG_DEFAULT_DEVICE_TREE="rockchip/rk3588-evb1-v10"
 CONFIG_ROCKCHIP_RK3588=y
 CONFIG_SPL_SERIAL=y
 CONFIG_TARGET_EVB_RK3588=y
+CONFIG_BOOTCOMMAND="load mmc 0:3 ${scriptaddr} /boot/boot.scr; source ${scriptaddr}"
 CONFIG_SYS_LOAD_ADDR=0xc00800
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART_BASE=0xFEB50000
 CONFIG_DEBUG_UART_CLOCK=24000000
-- 
2.43.0

